---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Dr Yameen Qureshi | Insight Medicolegal" description="Dr Yameen Qureshi is a consultant psychiatrist based in Glasgow.">
  <section class="inner-page about-page">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="page-head about-page__header">
        <h1>Dr Yameen Qureshi</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">Consultant psychiatrist, Glasgow.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="about-page__body">
        <section class="about-page__section" aria-labelledby="clinical-background">
          <h2 id="clinical-background">Background</h2>
          <p>Dr Qureshi is a senior Consultant Psychiatrist with over two decades of clinical experience in general adult and addiction psychiatry, having held substantive NHS consultant appointments since 2010.</p>
          <p>He has an established medicolegal practice and is regularly instructed by leading pursuer and defender law firms in personal injury, clinical negligence, regulatory, employment and other complex litigation matters.</p>
          <p>His expertise encompasses psychiatric diagnosis, causation, prognosis and the assessment of functional impairment. He provides independent, evidence-based opinions, drawing upon his extensive clinical experience and a thorough understanding of the requirements of medicolegal practice.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="about-page__section" aria-labelledby="qualifications-experience">
          <h2 id="qualifications-experience">Qualifications</h2>
          <p>MBBS · MRCPsych · MSc in Alcohol and Drug Addiction · FRCPsych.</p>
          <p>He also holds expert witness accreditation from the Universities of Aberdeen and Cardiff.</p>
          <p>GMC number: 4771627.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="about-page__section" aria-labelledby="independent-opinion">
          <h2 id="independent-opinion">Expert reports</h2>
          <p>He prepares psychiatric reports for legal cases, insurers and professional regulators.</p>
          <a class="button button-dark" href="/contact">Ask about a report ↗</a>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
